khabar Yeh Khalq Ko Jibreel Ne Sunayi Hai<br>
<br>
1. Kiya Hai Waar Sitamgar Ne Poori Shiddat Se<br>
<br>
shigaafta Huva Sar Murtuza Ka Zarbat Se<br>
<br>
radap Rahe Hain Ali Dard Intehayi Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Bapa Huvi Hai Jo Koofe Me Karbala Dekho<br>
<br>
ali Wali Se Jo Ummat Ne Ki Dagha Dekho<br>
<br>
imam-e-waqt Se Yeh Kaisi Bewafayi Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
3. Lahu Me Tar Hai Ruq-e-buturab Wavaila<br>
<br>
nabi Ko Khuld Me Hai Izteraab Wavaila<br>
<br>
gham-o-alam Ki Fiza Zindagi Pe Chayi Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Hasan Hussain Hai Baba Ko Dekhkar Maghmoom<br>
<br>
saroun Ko Peet Ke Roti Hain Zainab-o-kulsoom<br>
<br>
shadeed Gham Hai Musebat Yeh Kaisi Aayi Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Asar Se Zeher Ke Moula Pe Hai Ghashi Taari<br>
<br>
wasiyatoun Ka Musalsal Hai Silsila Jaari<br>
<br>
yeh Jaante Hain Ke Bachoun Se Ab Judayi Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Hasan Hussain Se Farma Rahe Hai Yeh Moula<br>
<br>
sitam Ke Waar Se Bachna Muhaal Hai Mera<br>
<br>
shaqi Ne Tegh-e-sitam Zeher Me Bujhayi Hai<br>
<br>
<br>
